{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This 45-minute demo will familiarize you with all the game's mechanisms. You'll find 12 recipes and around 20 unlockable items for your restaurant!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Full game content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or up to 4 players online. Open your own Bakery caf\u00e9 and grow your business by serving your customers the delicious dishes you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552210/extras/Gif_01.gif?t=1745307996\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and furnish your caf\u00e9 according to your desires. Place tables for customers, decorate and organize your kitchen to be productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552210/extras/Gif_02.gif?t=1745307996\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your orders for raw materials so you always have something to offer your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552210/extras/Gif_03.gif?t=1745307996\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a varied and demanding culinary experience. Be careful not to keep customers waiting, they could become unhappy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552210?t=1745307996","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552210?t=1745307996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552210/9bc292027a0e78721ea19b5a36794ef8df03f208/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745307996","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552210/9bc292027a0e78721ea19b5a36794ef8df03f208/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745307996","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"d